diff --git a/docs/notes.md b/docs/notes.md
index eec7730..af7baad 100644
--- a/docs/notes.md
+++ b/docs/notes.md
@@ -87,3 +87,12 @@
 - CSS: `.leaderboard-item` (pill like `.leader`, Place badge, name ellipsis, points 900, Winner pink badge, `:has(Winner)` highlighted like is-winner), `.play-result` column + `.play-status` for place/points/won (`#my-won` larger). No external CSS.
 - Security: player open/closed JSON/HTML never includes points/place/won/leaderboard (result null); moderator JSON includes all but Basic required. No external calls. All under `storage/`.
 - Edge: 0 players => leaderboard [], no winners; all 0 => Top/Draw []; 1 positive N=2 => [Alice] both Top/Draw; tie N=1 (both 2pts) => Top always fastest, Draw random Alice/Bob across clicks; last pick counts; inactive skipped via snapshot filter; deleted Q skipped.
+
+## Timer (per-question countdown, moderator big screen only)
+- Quiz settings: `timer_minutes` + `timer_seconds` ints default 0 (migration `AddTimerToQuizzes`), `Quiz` validates presence + `only_integer >=0`, `timer_total_seconds=m*60+s` (clamp <0 to 0), `timer_enabled?=>total>0`. Form (`quizzes/_form`): `label Timer minutes/seconds` + `number_field min0 step1 placeholder+aria-label` exact, new defaults 0, edit shows current. Controller permits both, missing params default via attribute (old title-only POSTs pass). Export unchanged (title/questions only, no timer); import ignores extra keys, creates with 0:0.
+- Game: `timer_total_seconds/enabled?` via quiz (live, like winners_n), `timer_expires_at=question_opened_at+total`, `timer_remaining_ms/seconds` (ceil, 0 if expired), `Game.format_timer` M:SS (`m:s.rjust(2,0)` => 1:30, 0:05, 0:00), `timer_expired?` (open+enabled+now>=exp), `auto_finish_expired!` (quick check then `transaction{lock!; recheck Time.current; status=closed; save!}` idempotent).
+- Controllers: `GamesController#show/state` + `PlayController#show/state/answer/restore` call `auto_finish_expired!` before render (so expiry closes even if only players poll; reload shows closed). `moderator_state_json` includes `timer:{total_seconds,remaining_ms,remaining_seconds,text,expires_at,enabled}` + flat `timer_text/total/remaining_ms/remaining_seconds/expires_at` (null unless open+enabled); `player_state_json` never includes timer (no leak, verified keys). `prepare_show_data` sets `@timer_*` for server-rendered `0:05` before JS.
+- Big screen (`games/show`): `<div id=timer.timer role=timer aria-label="Time left" hidden unless open+enabled data-expires-at/total/remaining>` with `M:SS` when open+enabled, else hidden+empty. Inside `view-question` (hidden when not playing), after `question-progress`, before body. Players (`play/show`) have no `#timer` element and no M:SS text.
